WEBVTT

00:02.080 --> 00:02.920
Hm?

00:03.500 --> 00:05.790
Oh! Mornin'!

00:06.960 --> 00:09.000
She's wearing her summer uniform...

00:09.000 --> 00:09.880
Hmm?

00:09.880 --> 00:11.540
It's Peyoung yakisoba.

00:11.540 --> 00:13.170
Wasn't asking.

00:14.750 --> 00:17.130
Crap though, we changed uniforms as of today.

00:17.130 --> 00:19.250
Maybe I can just casually dress down.

00:20.920 --> 00:24.500
Feels like summer's here already
now that we changed uniforms.

00:24.500 --> 00:28.040
Even though we only swap out our cardigans for vests?

00:29.500 --> 00:31.670
These skirts are completely different too.

00:31.670 --> 00:32.670
Feel for yourself.

00:39.170 --> 00:41.920
W-why are you half undressed?

00:41.920 --> 00:44.080
