02:15.330 --> 02:16.670
Summer already...

02:16.670 --> 02:18.420
I hate this time of year.

02:18.960 --> 02:21.670
But, this time around you have Yamada.

02:21.670 --> 02:22.540
Get lost.

02:23.040 --> 02:25.080
Don't go letting wicked hopes like that build up.

02:25.080 --> 02:28.040
Not like anything even happened over Golden Week.

02:28.290 --> 02:30.750
She's been super busy lately, too.

02:34.210 --> 02:36.040
You sure seem to be in a good mood.

02:36.250 --> 02:38.960
Let me guess, you got the part from that audition?

02:38.960 --> 02:41.710
SHH! That info's not public!

02:41.710 --> 02:43.000
What's this about?

02:43.000 --> 02:45.500
Huh? Nothing, just...

02:45.500 --> 02:47.580
Good morning, class!

02:48.580 --> 02:49.880
Today's the day you've all been waiting for!

02:49.880 --> 02:52.210
Let's pick our school trip groups!

02:54.830 --> 02:57.290
<b>Kyoto & Nara</b>

02:57.960 --> 03:00.170
Gotta split into groups, huh?

03:01.380 --> 03:02.330
Hmm?

03:02.330 --> 03:04.080
The twelfth...

03:06.630 --> 03:07.790
Something wrong?

03:07.790 --> 03:09.710
Huh? N-No!

03:09.880 --> 03:11.210
Anna!

03:11.920 --> 03:13.790
Yeah, coming!

03:16.830 --> 03:18.130
Ichikawa!

03:19.000 --> 03:21.880
Let's group up. We can ask Yamada, too.

03:21.880 --> 03:24.960
What? Why Yamada?

03:25.130 --> 03:27.880
What do you mean why? Aren't you friends?

03:30.460 --> 03:31.880
Cut it out!

03:33.670 --> 03:35.080
I'll go ask, then.

03:35.080 --> 03:35.750
Huh?

03:38.250 --> 03:40.000
Stop it!

03:40.540 --> 03:41.670
What's wrong?

03:41.960 --> 03:45.920
If you still need someone, I don't mind joining...

03:47.460 --> 03:49.670
Hey! Ichikawa says he'll join!

03:49.670 --> 03:50.330
Huh?

03:50.330 --> 03:52.920
Uhh, we're only picking roommates, here.

03:52.920 --> 03:55.330
What?! B-but Kanzaki said-!

03:55.670 --> 03:59.130
I was talking about Teppei Yamada, obviously.

04:04.210 --> 04:05.750
Why does nothing ever go right?

04:21.580 --> 04:23.000
What's going on?

04:23.210 --> 04:26.420
<b>Kyoto & Nara</b>

04:23.380 --> 04:26.080
She doesn't seem like herself.

04:26.460 --> 04:28.880
It's like something's bothering her.

04:28.880 --> 04:30.130
A first kiss.

04:31.540 --> 04:33.750
The school trip arc of Kimi-iro Octave

04:33.750 --> 04:38.630
<b>I know.
I was going to tell you myself.
I just can't beat you.
I'm so in love with you.</b>

04:33.750 --> 04:34.830
has a first kiss scene.

04:34.830 --> 04:37.330
There's a real chance this is on her mind.

04:37.330 --> 04:38.250
Get outta here!

04:43.750 --> 04:45.500
Is she thinking about that?

04:45.500 --> 04:47.540
On our trip?

04:52.500 --> 04:55.130
<b>Tea Shop</b>

04:52.500 --> 04:53.960
We're drenched.

04:53.960 --> 04:55.000
Yeah...

04:57.830 --> 04:58.580
Here!

05:00.580 --> 05:02.420
I can do this myself!

05:02.420 --> 05:03.460
Just let me.

05:03.460 --> 05:04.420
No!

05:15.960 --> 05:17.380
What am I thinking? Get a grip!

05:17.380 --> 05:18.830
School trips are a waste of time!

05:18.830 --> 05:25.210
What's fun about being stuck in a room
with people I'm not even real friends with?!

05:32.420 --> 05:36.580
Why did I hang on to this even though I didn't go?

05:34.210 --> 05:37.170
<b>School Camp
Nagano
Kyotaro Ichikawa</b>

05:39.000 --> 05:42.960
<b>Daijuni Junior High School Trip</b>

05:39.080 --> 05:42.040
Am I actually looking forward to this?

05:48.330 --> 05:50.000
Oh, you're still up?

05:51.750 --> 05:53.500
<b>Kim-iro Octave</b>

05:51.750 --> 05:53.210
Is that volume twelve there?

05:53.540 --> 05:55.420
Huh? Oh, yeah.

05:55.420 --> 05:59.330
