You can keep the one I lent you.

05:59.920 --> 06:02.500
Yamada's re-reading it, too?

06:02.790 --> 06:04.380
Volume twelve...

06:04.380 --> 06:07.130
The one with the kiss scene during their school trip...

06:08.130 --> 06:12.250
So, I wanted to talk about our trip...

06:13.920 --> 06:14.920
