06:19.330 --> 06:21.130
Well, so...

06:21.380 --> 06:22.750
Something on your mind?

06:22.750 --> 06:23.630
Huh?

06:25.040 --> 06:25.920
Well...

06:26.460 --> 06:27.500
See...

06:28.710 --> 06:31.540
<b>School Camp
Nagano
Class 2     Kyotaro Ichikawa</b>

06:32.500 --> 06:33.920
