06:39.080 --> 06:41.960
Hey, can I turn off my video?

06:46.710 --> 06:51.210
Know any good food they have in Nara?

06:51.540 --> 06:52.580
Nope.

06:52.580 --> 06:54.880
Deer crackers, maybe?

06:54.880 --> 06:56.880
