06:57.830 --> 07:05.460
And just like that I was left feeling
uneasy and somewhat concerned.

07:07.460 --> 07:08.290
You catch a cold?

07:08.500 --> 07:12.170
<b>Caller has turned their camera off</b>

07:08.750 --> 07:11.540
No, I'm fine.

07:13.170 --> 07:17.500
