08:43.630 --> 08:45.170
See Kanna there?

08:47.210 --> 08:47.790
Snip-snip! Snip-snip!

08:47.790 --> 08:50.170
She's making celebratory confetti.

08:50.170 --> 08:54.420
She wants to pair some couple up during this trip.

08:54.710 --> 08:57.790
She made us all practice our flash mob act, too.

08:59.580 --> 09:03.540
You and Yamada are her top targets.

09:03.540 --> 09:07.750
Wha? B-but me and Yamada aren't, y'know...

09:09.290 --> 09:11.330
Then maybe I don't need to warn you.

09:12.960 --> 09:17.380
Do you want to be forced by a crowd to ask her out?

09:18.130 --> 09:21.500
Are you the sort that needs that kind of push?

09:22.130 --> 09:26.330
N-no! I can do it myself, now...

09:29.710 --> 09:32.460
Mind if I recline my chair?

09:32.460 --> 09:33.290
I do.

09:34.210 --> 09:35.380
Why?

09:35.380 --> 09:36.210
Sit down!

09:36.210 --> 09:37.330
Make me.

09:37.330 --> 09:38.460
What are you, three?

09:38.460 --> 09:39.080
Hurry up and turn around.

09:39.080 --> 09:40.330
Love is so strange.

09:39.080 --> 09:40.330
Hurry up and turn around.

09:40.330 --> 09:41.790
I need to be careful.

09:40.330 --> 09:41.790
Make me!

09:41.960 --> 09:44.500
<b>When?</b>

09:41.960 --> 09:44.500
<b>Next one is June 12th</b>

09:47.290 --> 09:50.000
<b>Nara Park</b>

09:48.290 --> 09:55.080
The best way to avoid causing a scene
is to keep my distance from Yamada.

09:55.790 --> 09:59.500
As long as we're not together,
they can't "celebrate" for us.

09:59.710 --> 10:02.420
But, just my luck, we're stuck in the same group.

10:03.040 --> 10:05.920
Aren't you all gonna give them some crackers?

10:06.290 --> 10:07.500
