11:06.880 --> 11:08.380
Haven't noticed?

11:09.130 --> 11:12.500
No, she's definitely faking that enthusiasm.

11:13.040 --> 11:17.790
She made this choice herself,
so there's not much I can do...

11:17.790 --> 11:20.000
But, it just doesn't sit right with me.

11:20.000 --> 11:21.170
She made a "choice"?

11:21.580 --> 11:22.250
Yup.

11:22.250 --> 11:23.710
Sounds like she knows something.

11:23.710 --> 11:24.920
