11:30.330 --> 11:31.630
Let's get going.

11:31.960 --> 11:32.830
Later.

11:32.830 --> 11:34.000
Yeah...

11:35.500 --> 11:37.460
"She made this choice herself"?

11:40.080 --> 11:41.630
What choice?

11:44.960 --> 11:46.830
Can't believe you're really eating it!

11:46.830 --> 11:48.210
Where'd you go?

11:48.210 --> 11:49.380
The bathroom.

11:51.330 --> 11:53.250
We shouldn't be alone together.

11:53.630 --> 11:55.130
We can't be.

11:55.130 --> 11:56.540
But, still...

11:57.710 --> 11:59.830
Okay, everyone ready?

11:59.830 --> 12:02.380
Nara's deer are real-

12:02.380 --> 12:03.920
-cuties!

12:04.920 --> 12:08.420
I want to know how she feels.

12:12.750 --> 12:14.540
<b>Welcome
Meguro Ward
Daijuni Junior High</b>

12:14.670 --> 12:17.130
