12:44.540 --> 12:46.750
<b>BOYS BATH</b>

12:51.580 --> 12:53.290
<b>ICHIKAWA</b>

12:53.540 --> 12:56.830
Okay. Now to just pop in, wash up, and get out.

12:56.830 --> 12:57.790
Hey! Ichikawa!

12:59.500 --> 13:02.330
Join us for some dick battles! C'mon!

13:02.330 --> 13:03.880
Why are you here?

13:03.880 --> 13:05.960
Wasn't Class 2 in here already?

13:05.960 --> 13:11.710
Yeah, but I accidentally walked into the
girls bath and got yelled at until now.

13:11.710 --> 13:12.830
"Accidentally."

13:12.960 --> 13:16.460
Think about it, though.
Right about now, the girls are like...

13:16.460 --> 13:19.250
