13:41.130 --> 13:43.250
Dude! You too, dude!

13:45.460 --> 13:48.250
Nothing beats a nice big bath.

13:48.460 --> 13:50.960
Huh? What's with all of you?

13:51.380 --> 13:54.960
It doesn't feel right getting to look for free...

13:54.960 --> 13:56.080
I know how you feel.

13:57.960 --> 14:01.000
Well I'm gonna take this chance to look REAL good!

14:01.000 --> 14:03.330
All right, that'll be 1,000 yen per second.

14:03.330 --> 14:05.750
One thousand, two thousand, three thousand...

14:05.750 --> 14:06.630
That hardly seems legal...

14:05.750 --> 14:06.630
One thousand, two thousand, three thousand...

14:06.630 --> 14:07.500
That hardly seems legal...

14:06.630 --> 14:07.500
...four thousand, five thousand...

14:07.500 --> 14:08.630
...four thousand, five thousand...

14:08.630 --> 14:10.750
Been in long enough already. Gonna head out.

14:10.750 --> 14:12.080
