14:20.540 --> 14:21.460
Don't.

14:21.460 --> 14:22.540
No luck?

14:26.250 --> 14:29.000
You enjoying the trip?

14:30.250 --> 14:32.710
Yeah. Lots.

14:36.630 --> 14:39.920
Time to get back and stake my claim on the blow dryer.

14:39.920 --> 14:42.380
You can go first.

14:42.380 --> 14:44.580
Yeah? 'Kay, then.

14:56.630 --> 14:57.290
