if she thought she'd get the part.

18:28.880 --> 18:30.000
You're wrong...

18:30.420 --> 18:33.250
A school trip like this is a once in a lifetime event.

18:33.250 --> 18:35.420
She'll have plenty of auditions-

18:35.420 --> 18:36.290
You're wrong!

18:36.630 --> 18:39.710
She wouldn't be down there like that if she felt that way!

18:39.710 --> 18:41.170
No, I mean...

18:41.170 --> 18:43.790
That's not the way she thinks in the first place.

18:43.790 --> 18:46.380
She wouldn't be here just because
she didn't have a chance.

18:46.580 --> 18:48.540
Then why is she?

18:51.250 --> 18:52.670
A-actually, never mind!

18:52.830 --> 18:53.460
Huh?

18:54.080 --> 18:56.000
I'm gonna go! I'll be there!

18:59.210 --> 19:01.580
For me...

19:02.460 --> 19:05.420
<b>Caller has turned their camera off</b>

19:04.080 --> 19:05.080
You catch a cold?

19:05.080 --> 19:08.040
No, I'm fine.

19:17.790 --> 19:18.960
I...

19:19.500 --> 19:21.460
<b>I...</b>

19:21.790 --> 19:24.790
I'm so stupid...

19:25.500 --> 19:27.960
<b>...Want to Tell Her</b>

19:29.630 --> 19:32.330
<b>I Want to Tell Her</b>

19:32.500 --> 19:34.880
It's so obvious once I stop and think for second!

19:34.880 --> 19:37.540
Yet here I was thinking about a kiss!

19:39.250 --> 19:40.830
It's almost lights out!

19:41.960 --> 19:43.000
I'll be right back!

19:43.750 --> 19:48.080
I know how seriously she takes the work she does!

19:49.420 --> 19:51.880
And this is for her favorite series.

19:51.880 --> 19:55.290
She's got to have been practicing like never before!

19:55.290 --> 19:59.830
Going to school, to work,
and practicing in what little time is left.

20:01.130 --> 20:02.250
But, despite all that...

20:09.130 --> 20:11.790
Because, she knew I was looking forward to this...

20:12.750 --> 20:15.290
I lied my way out of the school camp trip.

20:16.040 --> 20:17.080
This is my fault...

20:20.080 --> 20:22.540
<b>Goodnight!!
I want to talk tomorrow</b>

20:21.880 --> 20:25.040
Yamada? That's not your room.

20:25.210 --> 20:26.290
Sorry!

20:26.290 --> 20:27.290
Yamada?

20:28.080 --> 20:29.080
Huh?

20:30.170 --> 20:31.790
What are you hiding for?

20:31.790 --> 20:33.000
No, I was just...

20:33.000 --> 20:35.000
What now? Someone else over there?

20:35.000 --> 20:36.250
N-no!

20:39.580 --> 20:40.750
That you, Kobayashi?

20:40.750 --> 20:42.960
Huh? Oh, y-yeah.

20:42.960 --> 20:45.380
She forgot which room was hers.

20:46.380 --> 20:47.960
You're both over there.

20:48.130 --> 20:50.040
Now get inside!

20:50.580 --> 20:53.170
There! In you go! Good night!

20:54.000 --> 20:56.580
I'm gonna use these to do a face pack.

20:56.580 --> 20:58.960
A-am I...?

20:58.960 --> 20:59.830
You should try, too.

20:59.830 --> 21:03.580
Phew, these group leader meetings are a pain.

21:06.080 --> 21:07.000
You okay?

21:07.000 --> 21:09.080
Y-yeah, just tripped.

21:09.080 --> 21:10.920
Be more careful.

21:13.290 --> 21:14.040
Uhh...

21:15.210 --> 21:15.710
Wait...

21:16.540 --> 21:18.790
WHAT?!
